OL,3,GNEWSABudget pressures could mean
OL,4,Afurther council tax rises, leaders warn
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncils across the country may have to
OL,7,Fincrease council tax and make further
OL,8,Fcuts to services next year because of
OL,9,Fbudget gaps.
OL,11,FCurrent figures suggest Welsh
OL,12,Fauthorities are facing a shortfall of
OL,13,Fmore than #272m in 2027-28, according
OL,14,Fto analysis by the BBC Shared Data
OL,15,FUnit.
OL,17,FThe Welsh Local Government Association
OL,18,F(WLGA) said "councils continue to face
OL,19,Fsignificant financial pressures" but
OL,20,F"the precise position will depend on
OL,21,Fforthcoming Welsh and UK government
OL,22,Fbudgets".
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
