OL,3,GNEWSABudget pressures could mean
OL,4,Afurther council tax rises, leaders warn
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Welsh government said "every
OL,7,Fauthority is receiving an increase of
OL,8,Fat least 4% this financial year" and
OL,9,Fcouncils "will be planning on a range
OL,10,Fof scenarios at present and we will set
OL,11,Fout our budget proposals this Autumn".
